sequenceDiagram
    actor Host as Host
    participant UI as Menu UI
    participant Client as InternetSessionClient
    participant Registry as Registry API
    participant Helper as GCP Helper
    participant Server as WS Game Server

    Host->>UI: Choose map and mode
    UI->>Client: Create room
    Client->>Registry: POST /api/rooms
    Registry->>Helper: Restart web room
    Helper->>Server: Start with map and mode

    alt Server ready
        Server-->>Registry: Ready
        Registry-->>Client: Room code and link
        Client-->>UI: Show waiting lobby
    else Create failed
        Registry-->>Client: Error
        Client-->>UI: Show retry state
    end
